      "source": [
        "## Multiple Functions\n",
        "\n",
        "- I think it would be helpful to see actual tax percentage versus marginal tax percentage.\n",
        "- No one actually pays the highest 39.6%!\n",
        "- We recall our array:"
      ],
      "id": "c7d8d6c6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "taxes"
      ],
      "id": "5dea8e08",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Bracket %\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"40%\"}\n"
      ],
      "id": "0c3a2db9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "taxes"
      ],
      "id": "98b75fab",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"60%\"}\n"
      ],
      "id": "069b5074"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "def bracket_pct(income):\n",
        "\tfor bracket in taxes:\n",
        "\t\tif income < bracket[0]:\n",
        "\t\t\treturn bracket[1]\n",
        "\treturn .396\n",
        "\n",
        "bracket_vector = np.vectorize(bracket_pct)\n",
        "brackets = bracket_vector(incomes) * 100\n",
        "brackets[::20]"
      ],
      "id": "2cf697cd",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## \n",
